                <pb facs="0988" n="878" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg878"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.6363/147: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hammond</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-12-18T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>69. Department’s 68, December 8, 3 p.m. Department will await receipt of text of
                    French note of November 30 which it wishes to consider and discuss with oil
                    companies before sending further instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
